## Implementation Steps

1. Read current `capital-path-classifier.py` (314 lines)
2. Replace `TIER_0_SUBTRACKS` dict: CASHFLOW_SEED→MICRO_DEPLOY, LEVERAGE_ENTRY→ASSET_BUILDER, keep LEVERAGE_SPRINT
3. Update `TRACK_ALIASES` to map old names: `"CASHFLOW_SEED": "MICRO_DEPLOY", "SERVICE_ENTRY": "MICRO_DEPLOY"`
4. Replace TIER_0 in `CAPITAL_TIERS`: remove `no_product_dev`, `cash_first`, add `sleep_test_required`, `deploy_allocation`, `max_founder_hours_post_setup`
5. Update `classify()` output to include `deployment_budget` (= capital_usd), `asset_slots` (from constraints.min_assets), `per_slot_budget` (= capital_usd / min_assets)
6. Verify TIER_1/2/3 unchanged (only TIER_0 affected)
7. Run existing tests — expect some failures from renamed tracks

