- [ ] `sleep_test_required: True` present in all TIER_0 subtracks
- [ ] `max_founder_hours_post_setup` <= 5 for all TIER_0 subtracks
- [ ] Old track name CASHFLOW_SEED still resolves via TRACK_ALIASES
- [ ] TIER_1/2/3 outputs identical to before (no regression)
- [ ] CLI test: `--profile-json '{"capital_usd": 500}'` → track=MICRO_DEPLOY

## Risk Assessment

- **Track rename breaks downstream:** TRACK_ALIASES handles backward compat. Stage0 spec uses tier/track from classifier output — if spec checks `track == "CASHFLOW_SEED"` anywhere, alias resolves it
- **leverage.py import failure:** Already handled with try/except fallback. No change needed
